    "Platform Events Developer Guide \u2014 Retry Event Triggers with EventBus.RetryableException (the opt-in subscriber retry that is often mistaken for a DML lock retry): https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/atlas.en-us.platform_events.meta/platform_events/platform_events_subscribe_apex_refire.htm",
